{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10133050","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10133050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1013305001:2":{"text":"キャンプに人がこんな大勢来るなんて滅多にないことだ。それにメイジと聖騎士が一緒にいるのも珍しいな。","source_cn":"很少在这个营地看到这么多人，尤其是魔法师和圣骑士的组合...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDB0AE0AEA452F21B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"キャンプに人がこんな大勢来るなんて滅多にないことだ。それにメイジと聖騎士が一緒にいるのも珍しいな。","female":"キャンプに人がこんな大勢来るなんて滅多にないことだ。それにメイジと聖騎士が一緒にいるのも珍しいな。","variant_male_record_index":"114307","variant_female_record_index":"114308","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013305002:1":{"text":"……本題に入ろう。あなた方はここで何の研究をしているのだ？","source_cn":"……言归正传。你们在这里做的是什么研究？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98089FD50B77DBF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013305003:1":{"text":"本当は聖石の研究がしたいんだが、盗まれてしまったからな……ひとまず史料の研究をしてるんだ。","source_cn":"我们本想研究圣石的，但圣石已经失窃。就只能先从史料入手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B5BCF455E93B288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013305004:1":{"text":"たとえば初めて聖石が現れた場所とか……","source_cn":"比如说圣石第一次出现的区域——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6E91FC657CE4C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013305005:1":{"text":"ここなのか？","source_cn":"就是这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8D1081C5833741D","variant_status":"","male":"","female"